  "documentation": {
    "content": "Evaluate the environment in which your system is operating and identify whether the problem is environmental or hardware-related. Your system should be in a room with an operating temperature of 18C to 24C (65F to 75F). If faulty hardware caused the error, such as a bad temperature sensor or a broken fan, replace the faulty part as soon as possible. If you need assistance, contact NetApp technical support.\n\nThese events indicate that system may shutdown soon. So they may not get auto-resolved. The resolution is to get smart hands to act and remediate the heating/cooling in the cage.\n\n${metric_or_resource.labels}",
